<title>RUSSIA: Russia to auction 11 trillion roubles in T-bills.</title>
<headline>Russia to auction 11 trillion roubles in T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's finance ministry will auction eight trillion roubles of six-month GKO discount Treasury bills (series 22058) and three trillion roubles in a new tranche of six-month T-bills (series 22038) on November 13, the central bank said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
